OL,3,GNEWSAF1 driver George Russell opens
OL,4,Ayouth karting academy
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I know how hard it is for talented
OL,7,Fyoung drivers to get that first
OL,8,Fopportunity. I want to give something
OL,9,Fback," said Russell, from King's Lynn
OL,10,Fin Norfolk.
